# ─── popo .gitignore ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Only track APPLICATION CODE + docs. Exclude development-only reference
# folders, credentials, build outputs, and OS/editor junk.

# ─── Node / pnpm ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
.pnpm-store/
*.tgz

# ─── Build outputs ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
dist/
target/
*.exe
*.msi
*.nsis

# ── Environment / credentials (NEVER commit these) ──────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
popo-flow.json
**/gcp-sa*.json
**/service-account*.json

# Account-specific Partner Center package identity input.
**/partner-center-identity.local.json
*.msix
*.msixbundle
*.appx
*.appxbundle

**/firebase-adminsdk*.json
**/*-credentials*.json
**/*serviceAccount*.json

# ─── Development-only reference / skill folders ───────────────────────
*.pfx
*.p12
*.pvk
*.p8
*.jks
*.keystore
*.kdbx
*.snk
**/signing.properties
**/keystore.properties
**/*signing-password*

# These were imported for design research (Sessions 3–4) and contain
# third-party scripts that trigger CodeQL security alerts. They're
# NOT application code — popo never executes them. The relevant design
# rules are already integrated into docs/DESIGN_SYSTEM.md.
impeccable-style-universal/
taste-skill-main/
gsap-skills-main/

# ─── Tauri build artifacts ────────────────────────────────────────────
apps/desktop/src-tauri/target/
apps/desktop/src-tauri/gen/
apps/desktop/dist/

# ─── Editor / OS junk ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.idea/
.vscode/settings.json
*.code-workspace

# ─── Test / coverage ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
tap-testdir*/
coverage/
.nyc_output/

# ─── Misc ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
*.bak
*.tmp
